      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "彼らを眠りにつかせてくれたのだな？\n我が家に伝わる系譜図を紐解くと\nどうやら、彼らは私の先祖にあたるようだ。\nいい供養ができた。恩に着る。",
        "official_en": "You've put those souls to rest? Thank you. The truth\nis, I've done some digging through my family tree.\nThose old bones you fought... They were my\nancestors. But now they're free thanks to you.",
